# Pack PAYLOADS ship as GitHub release assets, never as git objects.
#
# A model is 100-400 MB. Git keeps every version of every file forever, so one accidental commit of a model
# bloats every clone of this repo permanently and cannot be undone without rewriting history. GitHub rejects
# files over 100 MB outright, but a smaller model, a partial download or a stray .data sidecar would slip
# through and do the damage quietly.
#
# The only things that belong in git here are catalog.json, the README, and the licence notices.
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.zip
*.sha256
*.nupkg

# Local staging area used to build a model before uploading it to a release.
staging/
